<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces scrambled F-16 aircraft near the Tak border as spillover from Myanmar attacks continued, while Malaysian authorities tightened security in Kelantan to curb migrant smuggling linked to the same tension. In Surin a vehicle collision killed six people and injured one, and in Chiang Mai a lightning strike killed one person and wounded eight. Thailand also announced plans for a safety group to manage Chinese arrivals and advanced rail connectivity with Laos and China. Cambodia urged full compliance with ICJ rulings at the UN General Assembly. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOb2ZJV3ctVC1RcExuVkkxWnBzMWhtdEgwTC1MYkVYZHRuNUJqQktvYkdOVFdEU3lrNmhNWlk0M2FINlhNOFhid0tFS1l1N0hma3ZlaFF6cmFpTkxLdmplY25MWXRpZ3E4Yl9sZ0ctb2Z0RjBRc2NEVEF6RWw0QjBWRmJtSEllTms0TGhIRUh2SzJNZF83SnZMVUZHNnQwaVNjelNtS3VwNlRlVzNNYkRYR2VpNmw?oc=5&quot;&gt;dailyasianage.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxOdVEwb0xZZnUxQXhvY1p5alYwZDgyYlJaeDJLbUlJVXFoSXlFU3hubDN5a1Z3akcxek1fNnkzOGZqRXNPNVBiLVlVSUctM181VVVSenVyX0NvX2lZcHlxUFRUdUJsVUFiUkJQUFpkZmNrSnVCVW90QzhvVWN2bEhXdC1oTEVBSjVNUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOZTdJRTNaUGdFODVMN0tnWGpweUxPTGNsdnVtNDhKZUJaS21LdnAxU3RhTXdhdzdDNTZ5RmZMOGY2anYtVjBCbC04V3RBUUZlcno4Q0ttZFNDdndsWnpCZ1JudldENFk3M1kzX3dmZFZ6Zy0xblRkUnFRbTNBNEdwemxXT1d0UEIwUV9XUGl5bGtGVmd6cXBfVHJiWkRvUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQeTZxOERRMlhHaVlMSWNIdjU1VmduUXd4aHZBZXlGelNLRFotUWh2eGVQa0FHMUtTejRURng3TkpVMVFWQzN2dkhqNTE2VUp4RkxwUlpoOE14MEZIQWRudUIteXNTRlg0ZlVlQTdMMzlLaEdMd080X09vczdFVGlrSWhqN1NXM0hqdjVwYWlTYUFqRFhQUFY4SWZR?oc=5&